            "review_text": "619jedb\nCape Town, South Africa141 contributions\n0\nGood Food - Great Value\nApr 2017 • Solo\nAte here by chance and we were glad we did. Sat at a table not on the deck which helped my knees & back. Hanoi beers were cheap - a bit warm but that seems to be a Hanoi or Vietnam thing. Had a starter of ribs and sushi- both were excellent. Had some more sushi for mains - very good. Was vey full and meal cost us under 500 000 dong. Great food and good value for money- seems to be mainly a locals spot.\nRead more\nWritten April 18, 2017",
