            "review_title": "Review at Sio Sushi",
            "review_text": "Jessica Hewenn\nHobart, Australia33 contributions\n0\nUnexpectedly but fantastically lovely place\nDec 2014 • Couples\nThis sushi place just happened to be around the corner from where we were living in Hanoi, so we decided to check it out - and were so glad that we did! The staff didn't speak a lot of English, but they were super enthusiastic and friendly, and the menu was full of English so we were able to work it all out. The sushi was fresh, and the tempura sushi was incredible - I've never had it before, but I would definitely have it again! To top it all off, prices were good, decor was lovely and we just had a superb time.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 17, 2014",
